      "name": "CopySnapshotData",
      "signature": "void CopySnapshotData(void * pContext, void * pOutBuffer, int nCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Copies snapshot data from context structure to output buffer with thread synchronization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter critical section at pContext+0x8B4\n2. Copy nCount * 0xB0 bytes from pContext+0x8CC to pOutBuffer\n3. Leave critical section\n4. For each element, copy DWORD from pContext+0xBA8 array to output offset 0xAC\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Source structure containing critical section and data arrays\n- pOutBuffer (void*): Destination buffer for snapshot data\n- nCount (int): Number of 0xB0-byte elements to copy\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8B4: Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION in context\n- 0x8CC: Offset to snapshot data array in context\n- 0xB0 (176): Stride/size of each snapshot element\n- 0xBA8: Offset to secondary data array in context\n- 0xAC (172): Offset within output element for secondary data",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
