      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Waits for a file operation event on a Storm file handle.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates the file handle pointer is non-null\n2. Retrieves the event handle from offset 0x114 of the file structure\n3. Calls WaitForSingleObject with the event handle and timeout\n\nParameters:\n- pFileHandle (void*): Pointer to Storm file handle structure\n- dwTimeout (dword): Wait timeout in milliseconds (INFINITE = 0xFFFFFFFF)\n\nReturns:\n- void (wait result is discarded)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x114 (276): Offset of event HANDLE within file structure",
