      "name": "ComputeBase255Hash",
      "signature": "int ComputeBase255Hash(byte * pbData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Computes a base-255 polynomial hash from a 4-byte array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read 4 bytes in big-endian order (byte[3] through byte[0])\n2. Compute running hash: ((prev * 255) + current_byte)\n3. Apply offset constant 0xff01fe00 to final result\n\nParameters:\n- pbData (byte*): Pointer to 4-byte input array\n\nReturns:\n- int: Computed hash value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xff (255): Base for polynomial hash computation\n- 0xff01fe00: Offset adjustment constant",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:0aaf3f7fe8dbf71f19ebf8ab4d672c14",
