      "name": "GetCosineFromTable",
      "signature": "float GetCosineFromTable(int nAngleIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "float",
      "comment": "Looks up cosine value from precomputed sine table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Add 0x80 (128) to angle index to shift from sine to cosine\n2. Mask with 0x1ff (511) to wrap within 512-entry table\n3. Return float value from g_aflSineLookupTable\n\nParameters:\n- nAngleIndex (int): Angle in table units (0-511 = 0-360 degrees)\n\nReturns:\n- Cosine value as float from lookup table\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x80 (128): 90-degree offset (cos = sin + 90 degrees)\n- 0x1ff (511): Bitmask for 512-entry table wraparound",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:c0bf303c24a4efe363e60a160bbf7dd0",
