      "name": "InitFogSubsystem",
      "signature": "void InitFogSubsystem(int nExpansionFlag, int nUnused)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes Fog subsystem with expansion flag and default options.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set base path to current directory (\".\\\")\n2. Store expansion flag to g_fExpAltFlag global\n3. Call Ordinal_274(0,0) for setup\n4. Pass nUnused to Ordinal_286\n5. Configure option 2 with value 0x8000\n6. Configure options 1 and 3 with value 1 (enable)\n\nParameters:\n- nExpansionFlag: Expansion mode flag stored to g_fExpAltFlag\n- nUnused: Passed to Ordinal_286 (purpose unclear)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8000: Max option value for option ID 2\n- 1, 2, 3: Configuration option IDs",
