      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Signals worker thread shutdown and waits for completion.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter critical section at offset 0x854\n2. Set shutdown flag at offset 0xbf8 to 1\n3. Leave critical section\n4. Wait 2000ms on event handle at offset 0xbd8\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (int*): Network context structure (ECX, __fastcall)\n- IMPLICIT: EDX=0x60 passed to EnterCriticalSectionWrapper\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x854: Critical section offset in context\n- 0xbf8: Shutdown flag offset\n- 0xbd8: Worker thread event handle offset\n- 0x7d0 (2000): Wait timeout in milliseconds",
