      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "byte *",
      "comment": "Reallocates memory from pool with optional tracking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If g_dwMemTrackFlags is set, passes dwTrackingId to internal realloc\n2. Otherwise passes 0 (no tracking) to internal realloc\n3. Calls FUN_6ff68ac0 to perform actual pool reallocation\n4. On failure, logs error with file/line info via Ordinal_10028\n\nParameters:\n- dwTrackingId (uint): Tracking ID used when memory tracking enabled\n- pbBuffer (byte*): Existing buffer to reallocate, NULL for new alloc\n- nNewSize (int): Requested new size in bytes\n- szFile (char*): Source file name for debug logging\n- nLine (int): Source line number for debug logging\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to reallocated buffer on success\n- NULL on allocation failure (error logged)",
