      "name": "MemPoolSetField0",
      "signature": "void MemPoolSetField0(uint * pMemPool, uint dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets field 0 of a memory pool structure with thread safety.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Uses default pool if pMemPool is NULL\n2. Checks if threading is enabled (offset 0x1c != 0)\n3. If threaded, enters critical section before write\n4. Stores dwValue at offset 0 of pool structure\n5. Leaves critical section\n\nParameters:\n- pMemPool (uint*): Memory pool structure, NULL for default\n- dwValue (uint): Value to store at field 0\n\nReturns:\n- void",
