      "name": "CheckExpansionMpqExists",
      "signature": "bool CheckExpansionMpqExists(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Checks if the D2 expansion MPQ file (d2exp.mpq) exists.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return cached result if already checked (g_fExpMpqChecked)\n2. Get install path via Ordinal_10116 (GetInstallPath)\n3. Append \"d2exp.mpq\" and check with GetFileAttributesA\n4. If not found in install path, try current directory\n5. If still not found, check g_fExpAltFlag via Ordinal_10117\n6. Cache and return result\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- true (1) if expansion MPQ exists or alternate check passes\n- false (0) if file not found and no alternate flag set\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10116: Gets D2 install path from registry\n- Ordinal_10117: Returns g_fExpAltFlag value",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
