      "name": "AllocDataArrayEntry",
      "signature": "dword AllocDataArrayEntry(int * pArray)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Allocates an entry in a DataArray structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates array by checking fValid (offset 0x108), asserts if invalid\n2. Gets record size (0x104), search start index (0x10c), and records base (0x11c)\n3. Linear search from search start for empty slot (first word == 0)\n4. When found: clears entry, assigns unique handle (0x118), updates count (0x114)\n5. Updates high water mark (0x110) if needed\n\nParameters:\n- pArray (int*): Pointer to DataArray structure\n\nReturns:\n- 0xFFFFFFFF if no free slot found\n- Combined handle: (slotIndex << 16) | handleId on success\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8000: Handle ID wrap value (prevents zero handles)\n- 0x100: nMaxEntries offset\n- 0x104: nRecordSize offset\n- 0x108: fValid offset\n- 0x10c: nSearchStart offset\n- 0x110: nHighWater offset\n- 0x114: nCount offset\n- 0x118: wNextHandle offset\n- 0x11c: pRecords offset",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:052a101a230c3ddc22bbf8ff66201a19",
