      "name": "WriteDebugToLogFile",
      "signature": "void WriteDebugToLogFile(char * lpszFormat, ...)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Writes formatted debug message to log file.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pass format string in EDX and varargs pointer on stack\n2. Call OutputDebugMessage with ECX=1 (log file flag)\n\nParameters:\n- lpszFormat (char*): Printf-style format string\n- ... : Variable arguments for format string\n- IMPLICIT: ECX set to 0x1 (write to log file only)\n\nReturns:\n- void (return value from OutputDebugMessage discarded)",
