      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Builds the full log file path from executable directory and filename suffix.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get executable directory path\n2. If successful, append backslash and create directory recursively\n3. Format final path as \"%s%s\" (dir + filename) into global buffer g_szLogFilePath\n\nParameters:\n- szFilename (char*): Log filename suffix to append to directory path\n\nReturns:\n- void (result stored in g_szLogFilePath global buffer)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x104 (260): MAX_PATH buffer size",
