      "name": "InitSymbolHelper",
      "signature": "bool InitSymbolHelper(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Initializes the imagehlp.dll symbol helper subsystem.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Early exit if already initialized (g_fSymbolsInit != 0)\n2. Load imagehlp.dll via LoadLibraryA\n3. Resolve 14 symbol API function pointers via GetProcAddress\n4. Validate all critical function pointers are non-NULL\n5. Create two sync events and spawn worker thread at LAB_6ff6dc70\n\nParameters:\n- None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (true) if init successful or already initialized\n- 0 (false) if DLL load fails or any required API not found\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FogInit: Caller during Fog initialization\n- Ordinal_10029: FogError - Error logging on failure",
