      "name": "CleanupSymbolHelper",
      "signature": "bool CleanupSymbolHelper(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Cleans up symbol helper resources initialized by InitSymbolHelper.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if symbol helper thread handle (g_hSymbolHelperThread) exists\n2. If thread exists, close the event handle (g_hSymbolHelperEvent) if set\n3. Wait up to 100ms for the thread to finish via WaitForSingleObject\n4. Check if DbgHelp module handle (g_hDbgHelpModule) is loaded\n5. If module loaded, call FreeLibrary and clear the handle\n\nParameters:\n- None (operates on global handles)\n\nReturns:\n- TRUE always (cleanup is best-effort, ignores failures)",
