      "name": "HandleDeadlockDetected",
      "signature": "void HandleDeadlockDetected(HANDLE hThread)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Handles deadlock detection by logging and dumping thread state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Log deadlock context via Ordinal_10030\n2. Call StubNoOp (placeholder for future deadlock handling)\n3. Report exception with code 1 and \"Deadlock_Detected\" message\n4. Trigger stack dump on the blocking thread\n5. Flush logs via Ordinal_10040\n\nParameters:\n- hThread (HANDLE): Thread that caused/detected the deadlock\n\nReturns:\n- void (tail-calls Ordinal_10040)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x233 (563): Source line number in Fog_Subs.cpp",
