      "name": "EnumerateProcessModules",
      "signature": "ModuleInfoNode * EnumerateProcessModules(uint dwUnused, HANDLE hProcess)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "ModuleInfoNode *",
      "comment": "Enumerates loaded modules in a process and builds a sorted linked list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load psapi.dll dynamically and get function pointers\n2. Call EnumProcessModules to get module handle array\n3. For each module, get file path, base name, and module info\n4. Allocate ModuleInfoNode (0x210 bytes) and copy strings\n5. Insert node into linked list sorted by base address (ascending)\n6. Return head of sorted list, or NULL on error\n\nParameters:\n- dwUnused (uint): Unused parameter (passed in ECX)\n- hProcess (HANDLE): Handle to target process\n\nReturns:\n- ModuleInfoNode*: Head of sorted linked list, NULL on failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x210 (528): Size of ModuleInfoNode struct\n- 0x400 (1024): Max bytes for module handle array (256 handles)\n- 0x104 (260): MAX_PATH for file path buffer\n- 0xff (255): Max chars for base name buffer\n- 0xc (12): Size of MODULEINFO struct\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GenerateStackTraceReport (caller)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:6ce20c24ac6c785d91126d8859782809",
