      "name": "LeaveSocketCriticalSection",
      "signature": "void LeaveSocketCriticalSection(int * pSocket)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Releases critical section lock for socket structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Add 0xc offset to socket pointer to get CRITICAL_SECTION\n2. Call LeaveCriticalSection to release lock\n\nParameters:\n- pSocket (int*): Pointer to socket structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xc: Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION within socket structure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- EnterSocketCriticalSection: EnterCriticalSection counterpart",
