      "name": "SetSocketNonBlocking",
      "signature": "int SetSocketNonBlocking(void * pSocket, dword dwMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Sets socket blocking mode via FIONBIO ioctl.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copies mode value to stack variable\n2. Calls ioctlsocket with FIONBIO command\n3. Returns 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n- pSocket (void*): Socket wrapper struct; SOCKET at offset +0x8\n- dwMode (dword): 0=blocking, non-zero=non-blocking\n\nReturns:\n- 1 always\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8004667e: FIONBIO ioctl command (set non-blocking mode)\n- 0x8: Offset to SOCKET handle in wrapper struct",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:8b977e8f2eee76a641b29a7a8359af3d",
