      "name": "PrepareExtendedPrecisionFpuCall",
      "signature": "float10 * PrepareExtendedPrecisionFpuCall(float10 * __return_storage_ptr__, dword dwOperand1Value, dword dwOperationCode, word wFpuControlWord, dword dwOperand1High, dword dwOperand1Exp, dword dwOperand2Value, dword dwOperand2High)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "float10 *",
      "comment": "Prepares stack frame for extended precision FPU operation call.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 32-byte stack frame for operand marshalling\n2. Store operand value in ECX to stack frame at -0x20\n3. Copy high-order operand values to local stack variables  \n4. Copy exponent values to local stack variables\n5. Prepare pointer arguments for callee function\n6. Call FUN_1002129b with operation code, mode pointer, and control word\n7. Return original ST0 register value as float10\n\nParameters:\n__return_storage_ptr__ (float10*): Auto-generated return storage pointer for float10 return\ndwOperand1Value (dword): Primary operand value passed in ECX register\ndwOperationCode (dword): FPU operation code passed in EDX register\nwFpuControlWord (word): FPU control word configuration flags\ndwOperand1High (dword): High-order bits of first operand\ndwOperand1Exp (dword): Exponent portion of first operand\ndwOperand2Value (dword): Primary value of second operand  \ndwOperand2High (dword): High-order bits of second operand\ndwOperand2Exp (dword): Exponent portion of second operand\nIMPLICIT in_ST0 (float10): Input value loaded in FPU register ST0\n\nReturns:\nfloat10: Original ST0 register value cast to float10\n\nSpecial Cases:\nThis is a thunking function that prepares arguments for FPU exception handling.\nThe function does not modify the FPU calculation itself, only marshals arguments.\nReturn value preserves the original FPU state before the call preparation.\n\nError Handling:\nError handling delegated to callee function FUN_1002129b.\nNo validation performed on input parameters in this wrapper.",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:d63502919c4c985cfbdccf3184dd15d0",
