      "name": "ValidateStreamPropertyId",
      "signature": "void ValidateStreamPropertyId(uint dwDosError)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Translates a DOS/Windows error code to C errno and stores both in TLS.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store dwDosError in TLS OS error slot (offset +3)\n2. Search g_DosToErrnoMap for exact match (8-byte entries: DOS code, errno)\n3. If found, store mapped errno in TLS errno slot (offset +2)\n4. Range mappings for unmapped codes:\n   - 0x13-0x24 (19-36): EACCES (0xd) - access/write protect errors\n   - 0xbc-0xca (188-202): ENOEXEC (0x8) - exec format errors\n   - Default: EINVAL (0x16)\n\nParameters:\n- dwDosError (uint): Windows/DOS error code to translate\n\nReturns:\n- void (errno stored in TLS)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xd (13): EACCES - permission denied\n- 0x8 (8): ENOEXEC - exec format error\n- 0x16 (22): EINVAL - invalid argument (default)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:ef14b972a786ba8645bf0ac0ecb3d27f",
