      "signature": "int ProcessCharacterDataWithHooks(char * lpszData)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Processes character data through pre-processing and post-processing hooks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call pre-processor function on the input data\n2. Call main processing function and capture result\n3. Call post-processor function on the input data\n4. Return the result from main processing function\n\nParameters:\nlpszData (char *) - pointer to character data to process\n\nReturns:\nResult code from main processing function (FUN_6fb9a6e7)",
